Package: dafsteach
Title: Interactive R Exercises for Data Analytics For Sustainability
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jan Pieter", "van der Pol", email = "j.p.g.vanderpol@uu.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A browser-based learning app for the R track of the Data Analytics
    For Sustainability course. Students work through lessons, write real R code,
    and get instant feedback. Progress is saved on the student's own computer.
